    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75211" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνί̄θ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Av.</u>
			865
		</span></i> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or
				<i>belonging to a bird,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίσκος</span>
			<i>bird</i>-cage, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				405
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα ὀ.</span>
			<i>fowl's</i> flesh, <i>chicken,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				510
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Nu.</u>
				339
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.5.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1141b20
			</span></i>: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ., τά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1590
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				45
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. ζωμός</span>
			<i>chicken</i> soup, <i><span class="en">
				Hegesand.
				15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῳ᾽ὰ ὀρνίθεα</span> (sic)
				<i>hen's</i> eggs, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				266
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> sg. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνιθεῖον</span></b> ,
