				<u>PS</u>
				p.94
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i> [In <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				274
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνιθέης</span> (trisyll.) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφαλῆς.</span>]</div>
